{
  "version": 1,
  "readme": [
    "ae-machine — the whole AE Machine, rebuilt in ribbit.",
    "",
    "A reconstruction of Emiliano Pennisi's AE Machine (a generative percussion",
    "engine for Max/MSP) from its user manual — see ribbit/docs/user/ae-machine.md.",
    "",
    "`seq` (markovseq) walks a 16x16 Markov matrix and sends every note on a lane;",
    "each voice's sieve decides whether the note is its own (fm 4:0, modal 3:1,",
    "drone 4:2, hats 4:3, sub 5:4, string 6:5, metal 8:1, crack 7:3 on lane 5;",
    "bd on 1; smp2/3/4 on 2/3/4; kick even / object odd on 6). Voices -> `mix` ->",
    "master, with sends into six effect buses (res, echo, space, cloud, dirt,",
    "robot), two micro delays (stutA/B), and `atmo` — the Deep Pad, which hats,",
    "crack and slice strike (the convolution you can play). `tape` and `atmo` run",
    "through `pads` (Breathe, ducked by kick and bd). `mix` also feeds `loop`",
    "(looper -> oxide). `fbm` feeds the effects into each other; `jumpers` throw",
    "dice on the effects; `terra` borrows params and gives them back; `warp`",
    "bends the clock. The pads take ~12s to arrive.",
    "",
    "Try:",
    "  /start",
    "  /seq note=37,60,55,43,38,46,44,58,37,53,49,64,37,48,56,65   transpose: re-orchestrate",
    "  /seq animate=trig          let the weights reorchestrate; /seq animate=none freezes it",
    "  /jumpers dice=30           the effects become an instrument",
    "  /warp fire=now             an elastic-tempo episode now (see /warp)",
    "  /fbm depth=0.4 4b          the effects start eating each other",
    "  /looper rec=on at=cycle    then /looper rec=off at=cycle — a loop of whole bars",
    "  /oxide disint=on wear=0.15 and pull /mix gain down to hear it die (/oxide counts down)",
    "  /object preset=steel_gong  another object on lane 6 (see /object for its read-outs)",
    "  /atmo gain=1  /hats out=atmo   hear the hats only through the Deep Pad",
    "  /terra hold=on             sculpt: released params stay where they were left",
    "  /save name=a  ...  /recall name=a 30   morph back to here over 30 seconds"
  ],
